-- Preserve the complete 216/595 catalogue after rotating the free preview selection.
-- These rows were part of the previous public preview, so they were not present
-- in paid_content. Upserting them keeps paid hydration complete while the new
-- public bundle exposes only the newly selected 45 techniques and 20 theories.

on conflict (content_type, content_id) do update set
  payload = excluded.payload,
  sort_order = excluded.sort_order,
  updated_at = now();

